From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:39:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: STEINS;GATE 0 TIPS screen

Instruction 10:33 and the TIPS screen (list, tabs, the tip text through the
original text layout) translated from Game.exe like the phone; 01:0E keeps
the text mode table the layout reads; the TIPS bits are the save system ones.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

